# Tujuan: Membatasi Docker build context agar source control, runtime data, dan konfigurasi bersecret tidak masuk image.
# Caller: Docker/BuildKit untuk Dockerfile.frontend dan Dockerfile.backend.
# Dependensi: Pola ignore Docker.
# Main Functions: Mengecualikan dependency/build cache, env/compose, runtime output, dan database lokal.
# Side Effects: Mengurangi build context dan mencegah file operasional sensitif disalin ke layer image.

.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.next
out
coverage
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.DS_Store
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yaml

# Runtime data must live in persistent Docker volumes, not in the image.
runtime
python_backend/data
python_backend/output
python_backend/__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc

# SQLite files — use persistent volumes, not baked into image
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
